# plans/reference/FIXED_REGION_ALLOCATOR.md P1: `build run` under the
# fixed-region allocator. The kept lines are the platform-neutral ones: the
# allocator notice (the build shells out to `self compile`, whose stdout is
# captured), and the probe's own data-derived output. The "Building" line is
# excluded because it names the host binary (`.exe` on Windows).
stdout_keep=^(Using fixed-region|checksum |fixed-probe|Error|error:)
timeout=600
